ee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9efdc472f63_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9efdc472f63_720.jpg"> </div><p>美网女单1/8决赛，郑钦文2-0战胜斯瓦泰克晋级8强，连场上演让五追七神迹。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-08/6a9ef87c74c27native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还在攀升！郑钦文获470积分和78万美元奖金 即时世界排名升至第52</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9efdbfd808e_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9efdbfd808e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9efdbfd808e.jpg"> </div><p>郑钦文2-0战胜斯瓦泰克，本届美网累计收获470个积分（40分来自资格赛），78万美元奖金，即时排名升至世界第52位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-08/6a9f2b1c180cdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一个一个来！郑钦文美网8强PK莱巴金娜，过往5次对阵 郑钦文仅1胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609080525372737.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: